worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_handler_rules.js"
  ceiling 694
  rationale "Browser interpreter for data/seed/handler-rules.lino (issue #1085 D1.3). JavaScript-first twin of native handler keys (clarification, punctuation_only_prompt, ill_formed, physical_action_question, opinion_question (the handler-rules interpreter)), added under R997-R999 (2026-10-06); growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling moved to 694 for issue #1175 R3 (follow-up round, 2026-10-08): the rule interpreter reads the prior_turn condition and the clarification twin passes the dialogue history to it."
